<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-18T04:37:01.196Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:37:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to target civilians in Zamfara, attacking a mosque during Subhi prayer, killing Governor Dauda Lawal's aide, burning homes and abducting worshippers. In Plateau, gunmen have killed herders, farmers and an Operation Rainbow commander, set fire to houses and prompted a curfew. Police operations in Benue have resulted in the arrest of suspects and the killing of three bandits. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNRVg0aXlnWTRHdk81aU1LbThMMktiemtaa0hfRnk4bFdlZWs5aUVYVjlhMGVXVjZQOXNraWNRTGFGMTNFTlJ3aVFwWGUzREphRDRnNlljVE5xZmFkSlVrMDVSOTZ0V2R1VzNfSTNtcU91eEhNeU5teDVuM2JBLVFCaHppNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPM0ZmYTRGRFlDYW8tejdiSnZEU0NKWnZHZG5GY0lDRmZGQjYyRVc5Ty1vNE1Lbll6WVVIY0kzYzF6Rzd2VDMtQkFnTEY3dFBGQzVZczY0YjBBV0dfMUg4RW1kVHVvS2ZDTUlqWnMyeHdGSVliV2ZkTVJpU0xOLU13OWlLaTBOcjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBNeVpvTFo2c1pmVmNhWXpTOC1oRGxTQkIwTllCN2w3MXRFVFp0Q2x5TVg4UV9kUWRkQUNSN25ocDZWd0QxSlVSTFV3T0NvaFhJZUlFTHVxVVpfTHZQMEFkR0Z2d3NlQXF6NGlmZDFiVWVESXZ3dWVtTEUwQWZXTlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5qVVpIdkZ3d0xuVzlmeW96NjBhX3gtc1pXQzVDci1TblRkbnpUdTY3bjBOUG5wTUhERWhDdF9ZdUZqcktxNllXWFh6Q3Z1WmdlVGF6cXpUOE11ZUhuUUlWNGZ2OHg2TnhOMlNwVlRkaldmc00?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5zOTJYcV9UeVhXUU9lMFM1WFE5cEdFQ3hUekRXSi0xOTc4aGM2bXNCaUVQZkdwQ1E1RW1tWExBQlBfWExuQWZvNWpzMzk4SWstVUVEYzZWSHZaRllSZXlfeGdvcW5lSWFhcTI2QnNBaE5hdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a